---
import DesignLayout from '../layouts/DesignLayout.astro';
---
<DesignLayout section="Operating System" title="Knowledge Base" focus="Which GreenSquare source should an agent trust when materials conflict?">
  <section class="ops-section ops-intro"><p class="ops-kicker">Source hierarchy</p><h2>One doctrine. Many artefacts. Clear precedence.</h2><p>The Knowledge Base prevents agents from treating every GreenSquare file as equally authoritative. It defines what is canonical, what is supporting evidence, how conflicts are resolved and how current doctrine propagates into downstream systems.</p></section>
  <section class="ops-section"><div class="ops-heading"><span>01</span><h2>Canonical hierarchy</h2></div><div class="ops-stack"><article><span>1</span><h3>Judgment OS</h3><p>Governing decision doctrine. Highest precedence for reasoning behaviour.</p></article><article><span>2</span><h3>Design language</h3><p>Canonical brand, language, visual and application standards.</p></article><article><span>3</span><h3>Decision Frame</h3><p>Canonical public method and conversion product.</p></article><article><span>4</span><h3>Audience profiles</h3><p>Primary context for user needs, tensions, sophistication and use cases.</p></article><article><span>5</span><h3>Social and content systems</h3><p>Downstream expression rules. They must not override the doctrine above them.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="ops-section"><div class="ops-heading"><span>02</span><h2>Conflict rules</h2></div><div class="ops-grid">{[['Current over old','Prefer the latest explicitly approved source over historical drafts.'],['Doctrine over expression','A publishing or design artefact cannot change the Judgment OS.'],['Specific over generic','When two current sources agree in authority, use the one closest to the task.'],['Evidence over memory','Do not infer a GreenSquare rule from prior model memory when a canonical source exists.'],['Flag material contradictions','If two canonical sources materially conflict, surface the contradiction before propagating it.'],['Version consequential changes','Changes to judgement, positioning, evidence rules or channel doctrine require versioned records.']].map(([t,b])=><article class="ops-card"><h3>{t}</h3><p>{b}</p></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="ops-section ops-dark"><p class="ops-kicker">Retrieval contract</p><h2>Agents should retrieve only the context needed to improve the decision.</h2><p>Every source should carry: authority level, version, owner, effective date, topic tags, downstream dependencies and superseded-by status. Retrieval should favour small, relevant canonical chunks over indiscriminate repository ingestion.</p></section>
</DesignLayout>
<style>.ops-section{padding:clamp(3rem,6vw,6rem);border-top:1px solid var(--design-line)}.ops-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.65fr 1fr;gap:3rem}.ops-intro h2,.ops-dark h2{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4vw,4rem);line-height:1.03;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.03em}.ops-intro p:last-child,.ops-dark p:last-child{font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.65;max-width:60ch}.ops-kicker,.ops-heading span{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--design-muted)}.ops-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:4rem 1fr;margin-bottom:2.5rem}.ops-heading h2{margin:0;font-size:2.2rem}.ops-stack{border-top:1px solid var(--design-line)}.ops-stack article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:4rem 1fr 1.3fr;gap:1rem;padding:1.25rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--design-line);align-items:start}.ops-stack h3,.ops-stack p{margin:0}.ops-stack p,.ops-card p{color:var(--design-muted);line-height:1.55}.ops-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--design-line);border-left:1px solid var(--design-line)}.ops-card{padding:1.5rem;border-right:1px solid var(--design-line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--design-line);min-height:11rem}.ops-card h3{margin:0 0 2rem}.ops-dark{background:var(--design-rail);color:white}.ops-dark .ops-kicker{color:rgba(255,255,255,.55)}@media(max-width:850px){.ops-intro,.ops-grid,.ops-stack article{grid-template-columns:1fr}.ops-stack article{gap:.4rem}}</style>